{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factory Life</strong> is a factory simulation from a worker\u2019s perspective, where you start alone in a small garage and grow into a modern manufacturing operation inspired by real-world production hubs. Build products, manage your team, and scale up through smart automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ASSEMBLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/58f87558d5e23cbed6c2c7093b12fc12.poster.avif?t=1771156265\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/58f87558d5e23cbed6c2c7093b12fc12.webm?t=1771156265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/58f87558d5e23cbed6c2c7093b12fc12.mp4?t=1771156265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever dreamed of building something big?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Before you build an empire\u2026</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2026you start in a garage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ORDER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/0b6a14731bbfd335b9ca0726c0815fa8.poster.avif?t=1771156265\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/0b6a14731bbfd335b9ca0726c0815fa8.webm?t=1771156265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/0b6a14731bbfd335b9ca0726c0815fa8.mp4?t=1771156265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Factory Life</i>, you begin with nothing but a small garage, basic tools, and your own hands. Assemble your first products one by one, earn your first money, and take the first steps toward something much bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a one-person operation quickly grows into a full-scale factory inspired by modern Chinese manufacturing. As demand rises, efficiency becomes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPROVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/19f1f5d8d9fb80002cf2cf185df2135c.poster.avif?t=1771156265\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/19f1f5d8d9fb80002cf2cf185df2135c.webm?t=1771156265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/19f1f5d8d9fb80002cf2cf185df2135c.mp4?t=1771156265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire workers, manage your crew, optimize production lines, and turn simple ideas into mass-produced products. Every upgrade brings you closer to running a powerful industrial operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every empire starts in a garage.</strong><br>The question is \u2014 can you build one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/d861867cdb6649bbe14d8ef943eb8e4b.poster.avif?t=1771156265\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/d861867cdb6649bbe14d8ef943eb8e4b.webm?t=1771156265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/d861867cdb6649bbe14d8ef943eb8e4b.mp4?t=1771156265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Start from scratch</strong> \u2013 assemble products manually in your garage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Produce real consumer electronics</strong> \u2013 phones, speakers, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfed <strong>Grow into a factory</strong> \u2013 unlock machines and automated production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc77 <strong>Manage your workforce</strong> \u2013 hire, assign, and optimize your crew</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Optimize &amp; expand</strong> \u2013 faster production, better profits, bigger scale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Progress-based gameplay</strong> \u2013 from solo worker to factory manager</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD EMPIRE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/6dca1bb6c39352cabba78c5f3425fe76.poster.avif?t=1771156265\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/6dca1bb6c39352cabba78c5f3425fe76.webm?t=1771156265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/6dca1bb6c39352cabba78c5f3425fe76.mp4?t=1771156265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462580?t=1771156265","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/d66d1d91cb6dd28a661dac3779cfc9a2b630ff03/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771156265","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/3c7a4c21e656db2d4aa9d7764255fc3bb0d68f24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771156265","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/3c7a4c21e656db2d4aa9d7764255fc3bb0d68f24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771156265","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4065630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factory Life</strong> is a factory simulation from a worker\u2019s perspective, where you start alone in a small garage and grow into a modern manufacturing operation inspired by real-world production hubs. Build products, manage your team, and scale up through smart automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ASSEMBLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/58f87558d5e23cbed6c2c7093b12fc12.poster.avif?t=1771156265\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462580/extras/58f87558d5e23cbed6c2c7093b12fc12.webm?t=1771156265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so